1. **No Podoboos** (lava fireballs) were seen in 1-4 and the seven firebars are all six balls long; `src/world1.js` has a Podoboo class, but `src/levels/w1_4.js` places none (`tools/levels_w1.json` lists three decoded Podoboo entries flagged `hard`, which the level generator leaves out; I assume they are hard-mode-only entries). Whether that matches the original is from my memory only (*assumed*; I recall Podoboos in the 1-4 lava).
